261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 230 0 R
/E (The diamond and precious metals industry faces several challenges such as lack of transparency, fraud, unethical sourcing, and complex supply chains. Diamonds and metals like gold pass through many intermediaries before reaching the final consumer. This makes it difficult to verify authenticity and origin. Blockchain technology offers a solution by providing a secure, transparent, and immutable ledger that records every transaction in the supply chain. This improves trust between miners, suppliers, retailers, and customers.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
